# Screenshots Folder

Add your screenshots here with these names:
- 01_main_dashboard.png
- 02_fix_code_mode.png
- 03_before_fix.png
- 04_after_fix.png
- 05_create_project.png
- 06_chat_mode.png
- 07_local_files.png
- 08_pr_created.png

Tips for good screenshots:
1. Use a clean browser window (hide bookmarks bar)
2. Use full-width view (F11 for fullscreen)
3. Capture at 1920x1080 or similar resolution
4. Show real data (not placeholder text)
5. Crop to focus on the important parts
